        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Baldwin ELK-RAR, Arched Elkhorn Handleset with Matching Rustic Arched Rose</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nA big entrance set, the Elkhorn measures 18-3/4 inches long. It is available to fit doors 1-3/4 inches thick to 2 inches thick, or 2 inches thick to 2-1/2 inches thick. The adjustable latch allows for backsets of 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches. Choose from a dark bronze finish or a white bronze finish--both of which have a 25 year warranty. As part of Baldwin's Reserve Collection, the Full Escutcheon Elkhorn Handleset has a lifetime mechanical warranty. It is available as a single cylinder, double cylinder, or full dummy with your choice of 3 rustic interior knobs or levers.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Baldwin Reserve Elkhorn Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Fits 2-1/8\" cross bore for both deadbolt and grip with a 1\" edge bore for both grip latch and deadbolt latch.</li>\r\n<li>Baldwin C-Keyway.</li>\r\n<li>Latch: square corner adjustable</li>\r\n<li>Strike: square corner</li>\r\n<li>Brass deadbolt features 1\" throw. Grip offers 1/2\" passage/privacy function bolt.</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt tested to exceed ANSI-BHMA Grade 2 Security.</li>\r\n<li>Warranty: 25 year finish warranty and a limited lifetime mechanical warranty.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Elkhorn Covered Deadbolt Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Exterior Overall Length: 18-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Overall Width: 2-15/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Grip Projection: 3-1/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Deadbolt Width: 2-11/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Deadbolt Length: 3-7/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Single Cylinder Interior Deadbolt Projection: 1-7/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Double Cylinder Interior Deadbolt Projection: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Trim Rose Width: 2-11/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Trim Rose Length: 4-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4\" - 2\" standard with optional thick door kit for 2\" - 2-1/2\".</li>\r\n<li>Backset: Adjustable for 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Full Escutcheon Elkhorn Handleset with Arched Interior Rose, Baldwin ELK-RAR",
                "description": "Baldwin ELK-RAR, Full Escutcheon Elkhorn Handleset - A big entrance set, the Elkhorn measures 18-3/4 inches long. It is available to fit doors 1-3/4 inches thick to 2 inches thick, or 2 inches thick to 2-1/2 inches thick. The adjustable latch allows for backsets of 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches. Choose from a dark bronze finish or a white bronze finish--both of which have a 25 year warranty. As part of Baldwin's Reserve Collection, the Full Escutcheon Elkhorn Handleset has a lifetime mechanical warranty. It is available as a single cylinder, double cylinder, or full dummy with your choice of 3 rustic interior knobs or levers.",
                "keywords": "covered deadbolt handlesets, traditional entry sets, classic entry sets, traditional front door entry sets, baldwin reserve collection entrance trim sets, grade 2 handlesets, single cylinder handlesets, double cylinder handlesets, dummy handlesets, BAL-ELK-RAR, Baldwin Reserve Collection Elkhorn Entrysets, Full Escutcheon Elkhorn Handleset with Arched Interior Roses, Baldwin ELK-RAR, Arched Elkhorn Handleset with Matching Rustic Arched Roses, Baldwin Reserve Elkhorn Handlesets, Elkhorn Covered Deadbolt Handlesets,"
